            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 1,
            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "malin_used_necromancy",
            value: "no",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "monolith",
            value: 0,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("You really think it was a good idea to send out a raidin’ party right after the orcs just attacked us? Father isn’t even here with us any more..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Nor is Darken Volk. We are truly defenseless."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Not like we even need him. No way we’re trusting a necromancer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Quit bickerin’, you two. With most o’ them orcs dead now, their camps will be lots weaker. Our raiders will clear ’em out and leave us a quiet summer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 13,
            y: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("So much for quiet, Drogan. Orcs amass north of the river!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("What? Curses! Why be thar still so many o’ ’em?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Well ya sent out a bunch of our soldiers before we even started ta fix the city walls..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Quiet, you. Malin, you’ve got ta hold tha river fort or they’ll overrun us. Tha raidin’ party should be back in two days ta help us fight ’em off. Fer now, I’ll send tha remaining guards to help ya."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "recruit",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_recruit_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22Walking%20Corpse%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("What in blazes is that... that thing? Has tha necromancer returned already? His timin’ couldn’t be any worse..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("No, Drogan. I raised this corpse with the skills Darken Volk taught me before he left. I have no love for it, but we need to take action, or we’ll never be able to repel the orcs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("I’m ’shamed of ya, Malin. Even if it’d ensure our survival, nothin’ good ever comes of necromancy. The moment ya use it, you’ve already sold yer soul ta black magic!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("What?! I am hardly evil, Drogan!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Ya say that, but you’ve been very quiet ’bout why tha mages sent you home from Alduin. I’m beginning ta think you were already dabblin’ in this witchcraft even before ya met that necromancer!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("No! No... it was something stupid, something silly... it does not matter now! I’ll not stand by and allow the orcs to destroy my home while I have the power to prevent it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "malin_used_necromancy",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 16,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
