            text: _("Someone left a dead fish here."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 2,
            x: "-1-16",
            y: "12-19",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("The orcs have broken through. Parthyn is open to attack!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Drogan%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Who will be left to defend Parthyn?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Dela%20Keshar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I’m... dying..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Soldier",
            type: "Swordsman",
            side: 3,
            x: 4,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Soldier",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_8",
            type: "Longbowman",
            side: 3,
            x: 5,
            y: 16,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_9",
            type: "Javelineer",
            side: 3,
            x: 5,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Soldier",
            text: _("We’re back from the raid, Drogan. Seems like we made it just in time!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kreg'a'shar Trr",
            text: _("More humans! We’ll need more fighters to squash ’em all. Grunts, retreat!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%222%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("The orcs are dead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_18",
        on: "branch_if_18",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "malin_used_necromancy",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("By all rights, Malin, I should have ya kill’d on tha spot. I can’t believe ya let that necromancer corrupt you. I s’ppose part o’ this is my fault since I let ’im into Parthyn, but still... Since I showed ’im mercy, I’ll show ya the same. I’m banishin’ you from Parthyn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Fine words, Drogan. Would you rather have let the orcs overrun the town?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Aye, better that than ta even dabble in dark magic. We woulda rebuilt this place like always. Even if I died, ’least it woulda been with dignity. Too bad tha mages didn’t teach ya more sense."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("I only did it to protect what I care about! Is this really what I deserve for saving your hides?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Yes, yes it is. Nobody’ll support ya on yer crazy path to depravity."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We should all be glad to see you gone, necromancer. I detest having fought by your side."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Dela? Sister?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Well..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Ya can’t support ’im on this one, Dela."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("I... guess you’re right. You’ve decided your magic is more important than us, Malin. I can’t help you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Begone, Malin. I’ve no wish to see yer face around here ever again."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_19",
        on: "branch_if_19",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "malin_used_necromancy",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Bravely done holdin’ off them orcs by yerself, Malin. But we’re not outta trouble yet. The raidin’ party reports that more warlords be gatherin’ their armies in the hills, just a few days north o’ tha Great River. I don’t know if we can fight ’em all off."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Then we must seek help. It has not been long since Darken Volk’s departure. Perhaps I can find him and ask him to aid us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("I’ll pretend like I didn’t hear that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Then what would you have us do, Drogan? Let the orcs overrun Parthyn? Abandon our families to those savages?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("Yes. Leave Parthyn fer now and rebuild later, like we always do."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Or we can drive off the orcs altogether and make sure they never attack us again. Surely I cannot be the only one who sees that what Drogan says is madness!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Drogan",
            text: _("If ya go out on a quest to seek depravity, none o’ us will support ya."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Better to die than to ally ourselves with a necromancer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Dela? Sister?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("I hope that you’ll stay with us, Malin. Be reasonable."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Be reasonable? I am the only one who sees reason here. If no one will help me, I will go by myself."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dela Keshar",
            text: _("Malin, seekin’ out the help of a necromancer is just... just foolhardy! We need ya here to help protect the town!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("You will eventually see that I am right, Dela. I am resolved."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%222%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22no%22%2C%22fire_event%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_18",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_19",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:modify_unit",
            side: 1,
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%2C%22race%22%3A%22human%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Malin%20Keshar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_20",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Malin%20Keshar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I’m not ready to die yet..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
